### META
directory_path: state
description: DINS setup state tracking per PART 6.1
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-01-28
status: active

### PURPOSE
This directory contains state files for tracking setup progress.
In production, the primary state file is /var/lib/dins/setup_state.
This directory serves as documentation and development reference.

### FILES
setup_state.example | Example state file format documentation

### STATE_FILE_FORMAT
Line format: phaseN:step_id:status
Status values:
- start: Step execution began
- completed: Step finished successfully
- warning: Step completed with warnings
- skipped: Step was intentionally skipped
- not_assigned: Step not applicable to this environment

### PHASE_ORDER
Phase 1: Runtime Environment Setup
Phase 2: DINSER CLI Installation
Phase 3: System Preparation
Phase 4: Docker Swarm Setup
Phase 5: Setup Docker Service Deployment
Phase 6: Final Setup Routine

### RELATED
install/setup.sh | Main setup script that writes state
install/_setup.sh/cli/dinser | CLI that reads state for resume
